sequenceDiagram
  participant Actor
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend
  participant Postgres
  participant Gateway as Blockchain Anchor Gateway
  participant Fabric as Fabric AuditAnchorContract

  Actor->>Frontend: Perform governed procurement action
  Frontend->>Backend: REST request with bearer session
  Backend->>Backend: Validate session and trusted actor context
  Backend->>Backend: Validate business rules
  Backend->>Backend: Build canonical event hash
  Backend->>Postgres: Persist business record and lifecycle event
  Backend->>Gateway: Anchor event hash when configured
  alt Fabric available
    Gateway->>Fabric: anchorEvent(proof metadata)
    Fabric-->>Gateway: transaction reference
    Gateway-->>Backend: anchorStatus anchored
  else Fabric unavailable or disabled
    Gateway-->>Backend: anchorStatus pending or failed
  end
  Backend->>Postgres: Persist anchor metadata
  Backend-->>Frontend: Business response with honest proof state
  Actor->>Frontend: Verify proof
  Frontend->>Backend: POST verify payload hash
  Backend->>Gateway: verifyEvent(eventId, payloadHash)
  Gateway-->>Backend: verified, mismatch, notFound, or unavailable
  Backend-->>Frontend: Verification result
